  VALUE x00 16:9
  VALUE x01 Auto resize
  VALUE x03 Original

FEATURE_CODE x14 Color Temperature
  ATTRS NC RW
  VALUE x02 Neutral
  VALUE x03 Warm
  VALUE x0A Cool
  VALUE x0B Custom

FEATURE_CODE x16 Color Temperature - Red
  ATTRS C RW

FEATURE_CODE x18 Color Temperature - Green
