FEATURE_CODE x1A Color Temperature - Blue
  ATTRS C RW

FEATURE_CODE x8A Saturation
  ATTRS C RW

FEATURE_CODE x90 Hue
  ATTRS C RW

FEATURE_CODE x59 Six Color - Red
