FEATURE_CODE xF3 DDC/CI
  ATTRS NC RW
  VALUE x00 Off
  VALUE x01 On

FEATURE_CODE xE7 Power Saving
  ATTRS NC RW
  VALUE x00 Off
  VALUE x01 On

FEATURE_CODE xF2 Power LED
